{
  "set": "restore",
  "description": "Fork Workstream A: build, remove, look at the ground. Each type twice: land restore off (upstream behaviour, the diagnosis) and on. Probes read the heightmap and paint texels and count what stands on the site; a vanilla road is laid across afterwards. mall-on runs first: its build is the first paint in a fresh city (no user splatmap yet).",
